@FuncoApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5047
@FunkoId = 1

### Lista Funkos activos
GET {{FuncoApi_HostAddress}}/api/funcopops
Accept: application/json

###

### Obtiene un Funko por ID
GET {{FuncoApi_HostAddress}}/api/funcopops/{{FunkoId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Crea un Funko
POST {{FuncoApi_HostAddress}}/api/funcopops
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Spider-Man",
  "imagen": "https://example.com/spiderman.png",
  "precio": 14.99,
  "stock": 5,
  "categoria": "marvel",
  "proveedor": 1
}

###

### Actualiza un Funko (el ID del cuerpo debe coincidir con la ruta)
PUT {{FuncoApi_HostAddress}}/api/funcopops/{{FunkoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": {{FunkoId}},
  "nombre": "Spider-Man",
  "imagen": "https://example.com/spiderman.png",
  "precio": 14.99,
  "stock": 5,
  "categoria": "marvel",
  "proveedor": 1
}

###

### Elimina lógicamente un Funko
DELETE {{FuncoApi_HostAddress}}/api/funcopops/{{FunkoId}}
Accept: application/json
